      "side": 1,
      "message": "If there is an error from the backing operation, it is possible the post filter might want to do something. Two possible use cases:\n\n1) We want to hide the existence of a file - change EPERM to ENOENT\n2) We want to create a fake file - handle the operation like classic fuse *or* actually set (in LOOKUP) the file handle to point to the file you care about.",
